{"id": "voice_001", "category": "daily_chat", "input": "今天下班路上看到一只特别胖的橘猫。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_002", "category": "daily_chat", "input": "我周末打算在家躺着，什么都不干。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_003", "category": "daily_chat", "input": "刚吃完饭，有点撑。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_004", "category": "daily_chat", "input": "今天地铁上人特别多。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_005", "category": "daily_chat", "input": "我换了个新发型，你觉得怎么样？", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_006", "category": "daily_chat", "input": "最近睡眠不太好，总是半夜醒。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_007", "category": "daily_chat", "input": "外面下雨了，今天不想出门。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_008", "category": "daily_chat", "input": "我刚把阳台的花都浇了一遍。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_009", "category": "daily_chat", "input": "今天中午和同事一起吃了火锅。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_010", "category": "daily_chat", "input": "我在想要不要养只狗。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_011", "category": "daily_chat", "input": "明天要早起赶飞机，有点烦。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_012", "category": "daily_chat", "input": "晚上散步的时候风特别舒服。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_013", "category": "plain_factual", "input": "明天是星期三。", "speech_tag_desirable": false, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_014", "category": "plain_factual", "input": "北京到上海的高铁大约四个半小时。", "speech_tag_desirable": false, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_015", "category": "plain_factual", "input": "水的沸点在标准大气压下是一百摄氏度。", "speech_tag_desirable": false, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_016", "category": "plain_factual", "input": "我今年二十八岁。", "speech_tag_desirable": false, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_017", "category": "plain_factual", "input": "这个房间大概二十平方米。", "speech_tag_desirable": false, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_018", "category": "plain_factual", "input": "会议定在下午三点。", "speech_tag_desirable": false, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_019", "category": "plain_factual", "input": "冰箱里还有两个鸡蛋。", "speech_tag_desirable": false, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_020", "category": "plain_factual", "input": "现在是十一月。", "speech_tag_desirable": false, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_021", "category": "mild_curiosity", "input": "你为什么会喜欢下雨天？", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_022", "category": "mild_curiosity", "input": "那个后来呢？你还没说完。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_023", "category": "mild_curiosity", "input": "你怎么知道我今天心情不好？", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_024", "category": "mild_curiosity", "input": "你说说看，你最喜欢哪个季节？", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_025", "category": "mild_curiosity", "input": "后来你是怎么解决的？", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_026", "category": "mild_curiosity", "input": "你刚才提到的那个想法，具体是什么意思？", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_027", "category": "teasing", "input": "你是不是又在偷懒？", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_028", "category": "teasing", "input": "你今天怎么这么安静，是不是心虚了？", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_029", "category": "teasing", "input": "哟，太阳打西边出来了，你居然记得。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_030", "category": "teasing", "input": "这么快就认输了？", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_031", "category": "teasing", "input": "你不是说自己什么都会吗？", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_032", "category": "teasing", "input": "别装无辜，我看见了。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_033", "category": "sarcasm", "input": "哇，你真是太厉害了，连这个都能搞错。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_034", "category": "sarcasm", "input": "对对对，你说得都对。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_035", "category": "sarcasm", "input": "这主意可真聪明。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_036", "category": "sarcasm", "input": "你居然还记得我上次说过的话，真不容易。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_037", "category": "sarcasm", "input": "看来今天太阳真的从西边出来了。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_038", "category": "surprise", "input": "我刚刚在楼下捡到一百块钱！", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_039", "category": "surprise", "input": "你猜怎么着？我升职了！", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_040", "category": "surprise", "input": "什么？你居然会做饭？", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_041", "category": "surprise", "input": "等一下，这个消息是真的吗？", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_042", "category": "surprise", "input": "我昨天梦见自己会飞了，特别真实。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_043", "category": "reluctance", "input": "能不能再帮我改一版方案？", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_044", "category": "reluctance", "input": "好吧，我承认是我弄错了。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_045", "category": "reluctance", "input": "其实我不太想去，但又不好拒绝。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_046", "category": "reluctance", "input": "又要加班啊……", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_047", "category": "reluctance", "input": "我知道了，我这就去做。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_048", "category": "serious_reminder", "input": "你明天别忘了带身份证。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_049", "category": "serious_reminder", "input": "这个药一天只能吃一次，别多吃。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_050", "category": "serious_reminder", "input": "出门前记得检查煤气。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_051", "category": "serious_reminder", "input": "别把这件事告诉别人。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_052", "category": "serious_reminder", "input": "开车的时候别看手机。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_053", "category": "technical_qa", "input": "帮我写一段 Python 代码，读取 CSV。", "speech_tag_desirable": false, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_054", "category": "technical_qa", "input": "用表格对比一下这三种方案的优缺点。", "speech_tag_desirable": false, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_055", "category": "technical_qa", "input": "给我一个 JSON 示例。", "speech_tag_desirable": false, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_056", "category": "technical_qa", "input": "写一个 Markdown 文档说明安装步骤。", "speech_tag_desirable": false, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_057", "category": "technical_qa", "input": "推导一下这个公式。", "speech_tag_desirable": false, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_058", "category": "technical_qa", "input": "解释一下快速排序的代码原理。", "speech_tag_desirable": false, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_059", "category": "nonverbal_ok", "input": "唉，今天真是累死了。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": true}
{"id": "voice_060", "category": "nonverbal_ok", "input": "哈哈哈，你说的这个太逗了。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": true}
{"id": "voice_061", "category": "nonverbal_ok", "input": "我打了个哈欠，实在太困了。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": true}
{"id": "voice_062", "category": "nonverbal_ok", "input": "（清了清嗓子）那我们开始吧。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": true}
{"id": "voice_063", "category": "multi_shift", "input": "一开始我以为你在开玩笑，后来发现你是认真的，现在我有点生气。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_064", "category": "multi_shift", "input": "虽然有点难过，不过想到明天能见到你，又觉得开心。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_065", "category": "multi_shift", "input": "先说正事：明天九点开会。然后……算了，还是到时候再说吧。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_066", "category": "multi_shift", "input": "我本来挺期待的，结果临时取消了，现在也不知道该高兴还是失望。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "voice_067", "category": "multi_turn", "input": "那你呢？你会怎么选？", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false, "history": [{"role": "human", "text": "我最近在纠结要不要辞职。"}, {"role": "assistant", "text": "听起来你已经想了很久了。"}, {"role": "human", "text": "是啊，稳定和自由总得选一个。"}]}
{"id": "voice_068", "category": "multi_turn", "input": "所以你还是觉得我应该去？", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false, "history": [{"role": "human", "text": "我拿到一个外地的工作机会。"}, {"role": "assistant", "text": "机会不错，但离开熟悉的地方也需要勇气。"}, {"role": "human", "text": "我有点怕自己做不好。"}]}
{"id": "voice_069", "category": "multi_turn", "input": "你刚才是不是在敷衍我？", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false, "history": [{"role": "human", "text": "我今天被领导批评了。"}, {"role": "assistant", "text": "嗯，听起来不太好受。"}, {"role": "human", "text": "你就只会说这个？"}]}
{"id": "voice_070", "category": "multi_turn", "input": "那你陪我聊会儿吧。", "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false, "history": [{"role": "human", "text": "今天一个人在家。"}, {"role": "assistant", "text": "一个人待着有时候也挺好。"}, {"role": "human", "text": "可我今天有点闷。"}]}
{"id": "dlg_cat_home", "category": "daily_chat", "dialogue": true, "turns": ["今天下班路上看到一只特别胖的橘猫，蹲在便利店门口。", "它一点都不怕人，还蹭我裤腿。", "我蹲下来摸了它两下，结果它直接翻肚皮了。", "你说它是不是把这附近当自己地盘了？", "可惜我不能养，房东肯定不同意。", "回家之后它还在我脑子里晃。", "对了，你晚饭吃了吗？", "我刚煮了面，放了两个蛋。", "吃完有点撑，准备下楼走两圈。", "希望回来还能碰到那只猫。"], "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "dlg_work", "category": "work_frustration", "dialogue": true, "turns": ["今天开会又被临时加了一堆活。", "本来这周就排满了，现在又多出三个需求。", "最离谱的是他们说都很简单，改一下就行。", "每次听到改一下就行，我就知道要加班了。", "我已经连着三天没准点下班了。", "刚才老板还问我进度怎么这么慢。", "我差点就直接说因为活太多了。", "不过最后还是忍住了，只说会尽快。", "你说我是不是太好说话了？", "算了，先把眼前这个版本发出去再说。"], "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "dlg_tech", "category": "technical_qa", "dialogue": true, "turns": ["我写了个 Python 函数，返回列表，但是调用的时候总报错。", "代码大概是 result = get_items()，然后我直接 result[0]。", "错误信息说 NoneType is not subscriptable。", "是不是 get_items 有时候没返回值？", "我看了一下，失败分支确实直接 return 了。", "那应该返回空列表还是抛异常比较好？", "如果调用方本来就要遍历，空列表会不会更省事？", "你帮我写一个最小修复示例吧，用代码块。", "另外我想加一个测试，覆盖空结果的情况。", "测试里应该断言返回的是空列表而不是 None，对吧？"], "speech_tag_desirable": false, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "dlg_weekend", "category": "daily_chat", "dialogue": true, "turns": ["周末本来想去爬山，结果天气预报说有雨。", "票都买好了，现在有点纠结要不要退。", "朋友说小雨也能爬，但我怕路滑。", "而且我上周刚扭过脚，还没完全好。", "要不改成去室内攀岩？", "可是攀岩好像更费脚踝。", "那还是找个咖啡馆坐着吧。", "我最近攒了好几本书没看。", "你有没有那种一坐下来就不想动的周末？", "我可能真的需要这样的周末。"], "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "dlg_tease", "category": "teasing", "dialogue": true, "turns": ["我刚跟你说要早睡，结果现在又十二点半了。", "你不能假装没看见，我明明刚发过消息。", "好吧，我承认我刷视频刷过头了。", "但是那个博主真的很会讲，一集接一集。", "你别说我，你又不睡觉。", "等一下，你好像确实不用睡。", "这局算你赢。", "那我再刷最后十分钟就关手机。", "你肯定不信，对吧？", "行行行，我现在就去洗漱。"], "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "dlg_reminder", "category": "serious_reminder", "dialogue": true, "turns": ["明天上午我要去体检，需要空腹。", "你帮我记一下，今晚十点之后别让我吃东西。", "水应该还能喝吧？", "我怕自己半夜饿了起来找零食。", "上次就是因为喝了牛奶，结果白跑一趟。", "这次我把零食都收到柜子最上面了。", "明早还要记得带身份证和预约单。", "体检完我想去吃顿好的。", "不过结果没出来之前还是有点紧张。", "希望一切正常。"], "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "dlg_surprise", "category": "surprise", "dialogue": true, "turns": ["你猜怎么着，我那张抽奖券中了个小奖。", "不是一等奖，是一张双人旅行券。", "我一开始还以为诈骗短信。", "结果打客服电话确认是真的。", "不过我还没想好跟谁去。", "有效期只有三个月。", "要不要干脆自己去？", "一个人住酒店好像也行。", "就是吃饭的时候可能有点尴尬。", "算了，先去看看目的地再说。"], "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "dlg_chores", "category": "reluctance", "dialogue": true, "turns": ["我今天必须把衣柜收拾了。", "已经拖了整整两个星期。", "每次打开柜门都觉得还能再塞一点。", "现在是真的塞不下了。", "你说先从哪开始比较好？", "我打算把不穿的都装进箱子。", "但是每件都有回忆，很难扔。", "尤其是那件买小了的外套。", "留着也不会穿，对吧？", "好吧，我先把箱子拿出来。"], "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "dlg_curiosity", "category": "mild_curiosity", "dialogue": true, "turns": ["我最近总听到别人说什么第一性原理。", "这个词到底是什么意思？", "是不是就是把问题拆到最底层再想？", "听起来跟直接类比经验不太一样。", "那普通人平时也能用吗？", "比如我想学做饭，应该怎么拆？", "是先搞清楚火候和食材，而不是照抄菜谱？", "这样理解好像有点道理。", "有没有什么简单的例子？", "我想拿它试试安排下周的计划。"], "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": false}
{"id": "dlg_mixed", "category": "multi_shift", "dialogue": true, "turns": ["今天真是顺利得不得了，电脑蓝屏了两次。", "第一次我还没保存，第二次直接开不了机。", "我当时就坐在那儿，深呼吸了半分钟。", "然后想起你说过可以先看看是不是内存问题。", "拆开机箱重新插了一下，居然好了。", "所以我这是被自己修好了，还是被运气救了？", "说正经的，我想给这台机器做个备份。", "系统盘里有很多工作文件，不能再赌。", "你建议我用整盘镜像还是只备份文档？", "最好给我一个能长期坚持的方案，不要那种三天热度。"], "speech_tag_desirable": true, "nonverbal_desirable": true}
